(7043820, 1070127, 159377, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. the lack of shadows for the cloned figures can give the impression that they are above the surface of the road. the checkered pants are a distraction.</td>', 'interesting idea. the lack of shadows for the cloned figures can give the impression that they are above the surface of the road. the checkered pants are a distraction.', '2013-05-27 11:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
