(7044488, 1070031, 6519, '<td valign="top">WTG, my friend, you survived your first challenge! Pat on the back for lying on your belly in the middle of the road for the cause!<br/> <br/>From here on forward, my advice would be to challenge yourself, maybe even try and beat your own score, but don''t let the votes get you down.<br/> <br/>DPC is spoiled by wonderful photographers and sets the bar a lot higher than other places do.</td>', 'WTG, my friend, you survived your first challenge! Pat on the back for lying on your belly in the middle of the road for the cause! From here on forward, my advice would be to challenge yourself, maybe even try and beat your own score, but don''t let the votes get you down. DPC is spoiled by wonderful photographers and sets the bar a lot higher than other places do.', '2013-05-29 04:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
